  "designer_notes": "Open 9x9: row 0, row 8 and columns 0, 4 and 8 stay clear as lanes; two blocker blocks (cols 1-3 and 5-7, rows 1-7), each with 2 free cells at (2,6) and (6,6). Goals OB06 x4 (plan 4, 1x2 pillars hp 4), OB02 x12 (plan 26), OB03 x20 (plan 69). [redesign 2026-11-28] CUTS: brambles 26 -> 12 (-54%), moss 69 -> 20 (-71%), both beyond the 20% rule because 99 blockers cannot fit on 81 cells. Compensation is layers, not counts: every bramble and moss is hp 3 (was 1-2) and pillars stay hp 4. Load = 16 pillar hits + 36 bramble hits + 60 moss hits = 112 hits on 28 moves (was 62 hits; the bot cleared that in 11 moves), 40 of 81 cells blocked (49%). Pocket rule: every cell sits on a clear lane or touches 2+ neighbours. Owner has not approved the cuts beyond 20%. Moves unchanged at 28."
